963
01:03:12,100 --> 01:03:17,350
[RUSS MILLARD]
Are you sure you don't want to came home? Mrs. Millard'll fix up the couch.
ເຈົ້າແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າບໍ່ຢາກກັບບ້ານບໍ? ທ່ານນາງມິລລາດຈະສ້ອມແປງໂຊຟານ.

964
01:03:17,850 --> 01:03:23,100
[BUCKY]
No. Thanks. I'll stay here.  I want to get up early and confirm these prints.
